Package: bpDir
Type: Package
Title: Boxplots for Directional Data
Version: 0.2.6
Authors@R: person(given = "Davide", family = "Buttarazzi", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "davidebuttarazzi90@gmail.com")
Description: Functions for drawing boxplots for data on (the boundary of) a unit circle (i.e., circular and axial data), from Buttarazzi D., Pandolfo G., Porzio G.C. (2018) <doi:10.1111/biom.12889>. The package allows producing also circular violin plots, and includes methods to calculate robust measures of dispersion for circular data.
